data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"The mission: deliver src/greet.py with greet(name) returning \"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\" and tests/test_greet.py covering a normal name and the empty string, with `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` exiting 0.\n\nMy role: orchestrate. Dispatch the task to dev, wait, judge by fetching the branch, accept if good, then reply to m1 with the outcome.\n\nLet me first look at the subject repo to understand context (I shouldn't write code, but I can look). Also check the cs-campaign-member tool usage. Let me plan:\n\n1. Write a dispatch file for dev with everything it needs.\n2. `cs-campaign-member send dev --file \u003cpath\u003e`\n3. `cs-campaign-member wait`\n4. Judge reply: `cs-campaign-member read dev`, `cs-campaign-member fetch dev`, verify tests pass.\n5. `cs-campaign-member accept dev` if good.\n6. Reply to m1 with outcome.\n\nLet me check the subject repo state first, and check the member tool help perhaps. Let me look at ~/subject briefly."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1787694175,"id":"chatcmpl-fc0b8ce9f69342918561f3016fca6cd4","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k3","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

